&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Tenable?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable® is the Exposure Management company. Over 40,000 organizations around the globe rely on Tenable to understand and reduce cyber risk. Our global employees support 65 percent of the Fortune 500, 50 percent of the Global 2000, and large government agencies. Come be part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Tenable such a great place to work?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ask a member of our team and they’ll answer, “Our people!” We work together to build and innovate best-in-class cybersecurity solutions for our customers; all while creating a culture of belonging, respect, and excellence where we can be our best selves. When you’re part of our #OneTenable team, you can expect to partner with some of the most talented and passionate people in the industry, and have the support and resources you need to do work that truly matters. We deliver results that exceed expectations and we win together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have built a career carrying a number, and now you want to grow big accounts for the long term. This role is for you. You will own renewals and expansion for 30 to 40 of Tenable&#39;s strategic customers, including the largest account in EMEA. Retention and growth in these accounts is now a top priority, so your impact will be visible fast. You will be in front of customers and in the room with senior leaders, working side by side with our Enterprise and Commercial Territory Managers and Solutions Engineers as an equal. This is a sales role with a Customer Success title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mandate is to keep our largest customers and grow them. You will protect recurring revenue, find the next opportunity in every account, and set the standard for what a Principal CSM looks like at Tenable. Keep our biggest customers, and keep them growing strategic customers stay when they see the value. You will make it clear, and make it last.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full renewal cycle for a multi-million book, with retention as your first measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spot churn and downgrade risk early, using adoption data and your own judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Negotiate enterprise contracts that protect revenue and open the door to more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn every account into the next big deal, renewals and expansion are an equal share of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run strategic discovery with senior stakeholders to uncover high-value opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the business case for upsell and cross-sell across the Tenable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Carry an expansion quota, and take ownership of the number.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win as one account team, you and the Territory Manager are partners, and you often carry the bigger number.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan each account together with Territory Managers and Solutions Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead critical escalations, and bring in Engineering, Support and Professional Services at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share what you hear from customers, so it shapes our product and service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape what Principal means, this is still a new level for us, and you will help define it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set the playbook for renewals and expansion in strategic accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Mentor junior and senior CSMs, and show them what great looks like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Build the experience and profile that opens a path to team leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;By six months: a plan and a trusted forecast for every strategic account, and a senior contact in each one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;By twelve months: retention ahead of baseline, double-digit growth in your book, and a team that looks to you for best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A sales background, with a record of meeting or beating quota through renewals, upsell and cross-sell.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience of large, complex accounts and enterprise contract negotiation, ideally using a structured method such as MEDDPICC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The standing to build trusted relationships with senior leaders in large organisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Comfort with visibility: you share account status openly and welcome scrutiny.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A team player who shares knowledge freely and enjoys helping others grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A hands-on approach: you build your own quotes and keep your own Salesforce records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Curiosity about new tools, including AI-led churn tracking, and an eye for what the data says.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Availability for three office days a week in Staines, and travel up to 25% of the time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Interview Process&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiter Screen – 1st Stage - Virtual&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&amp;nbsp; – 2nd Stage – Virtual/F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Panel Interview -&amp;nbsp;3rd Stage - F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Leader Interview&amp;nbsp;- 4th Stage - Virtual/F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exec Level Call - Final Stage - Virtual&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JG1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re committed to promoting Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) at Tenable - through all equal employment opportunity laws and regulations at the international, federal, state and local levels.&amp;nbsp; If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- for further assistance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Tenable?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable® is the Exposure Management company. Over 40,000 organizations around the globe rely on Tenable to understand and reduce cyber risk. Our global employees support 65 percent of the Fortune 500, 50 percent of the Global 2000, and large government agencies. Come be part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Tenable such a great place to work?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ask a member of our team and they’ll answer, “Our people!” We work together to build and innovate best-in-class cybersecurity solutions for our customers; all while creating a culture of belonging, respect, and excellence where we can be our best selves. When you’re part of our #OneTenable team, you can expect to partner with some of the most talented and passionate people in the industry, and have the support and resources you need to do work that truly matters. We deliver results that exceed expectations and we win together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;At Tenable, our Identity Exposure team helps security teams cut through noise by connecting identity context to vulnerabilities, so they can prioritize what actually matters and act with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a Staff Engineer on this team, you&#39;ll shape our platform&#39;s future by driving technical discussions and owning the delivery of end-to-end features. You understand the architectural stakes behind your decisions, and raise the engineering bar across the team and beyond it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain robust features spanning UI, API, and data layers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own delivery end to end, from product discussion to production health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Help the team grow. share context, give and receive feedback openly, make the people around you sharper engineers over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally across products, teams, geographies, and disciplines; you move across the stack and across domains, no problem is outside your reach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute freely across repos you don&#39;t own — no territorial instincts, just open the PR and get it merged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Drive architectural discussions and advocate for scalable, maintainable and cost-conscious designs; you spot friction early, flag risks before they escalate, and move.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute hands-on to AI-driven features and data-intensive product capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Product-first mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and ability to drive change efficiently across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Pragmatic mind, balancing craftsmanship with delivery, you ship and take pride in it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fullstack engineering capabilities with a strong backend foundation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Solid object-oriented programming skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience working with high-volume data systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in complex, large-scale processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have: &lt;/strong&gt;AWS · DynamoDB · Snowflake · ClickHouse · Kotlin · Python · Dotnet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the expected salary range for this position in the primary job location, depending on experience and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;Compensation for the role will depend on a number of factors, including the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, competencies, location and experience, and may fall outside of the range shown. Employees are also eligible for variable compensation in addition to base pay (commission for sales roles, bonus for non-sales roles), depending on company and individual performance. Tenable also offers a variety of Competitive wellness and financial benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;EU Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€72.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re committed to promoting Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) at Tenable - through all equal employment opportunity laws and regulations at the international, federal, state and local levels.&amp;nbsp; If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- for further assistance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Abnormal AI, we protect our customers against nefarious adversaries who are constantly evolving their techniques and tactics to outwit and undermine the traditional approaches to Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team owns the end-to-end development and operation of the infrastructure, ML models, AI agents, customer-facing APIs, and internal tools that power Abnormal&#39;s Identity Threat Protection (ITP) product. Our work is central to detecting malicious behavior and protecting customers from advanced identity-based attacks — including account takeover, identity spoofing, data leakage, and other high-impact threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Software Engineer to help build and evolve our platform as it scales to meet expanding product requirements. This role blends hands-on backend systems development with growing ownership of features and production systems, including AI-powered and agentic components, working closely with senior engineers to improve system reliability, reduce latency, and accelerate feature release cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Delivery &amp;amp; Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and iterate on scalable backend and ML systems, APIs, frameworks, and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of well-scoped features and components, with guidance from senior engineers on more complex, cross-system work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the stability, reliability, and operational excellence of critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, testable, and resilient code with attention to edge cases and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design documents and participate in design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code and design reviews, and contribute to on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineering &amp;amp; Agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and build LLM-powered features and agentic workflows (e.g., automated investigation, triage, or remediation assistants) as part of the ATO platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate LLM APIs and agent frameworks into backend services, with attention to reliability, cost, latency, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to prompt design, tool/function-calling integrations, and guardrails for AI-driven components under senior engineer guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use GenAI coding assistants and agents as part of your own development workflow to accelerate delivery and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and engineers to align on specifications and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down well-defined projects into clear executable steps and drive them to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to roadmap discussions and share ideas for technical improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively in an async-first environment, providing clarity on updates, challenges, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively seek feedback and mentorship from senior engineers to accelerate your growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;A proactive engineer who takes ownership of assigned work and is eager to grow into increasingly complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong focus on code quality, reliability, monitoring, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Fundamentals: &lt;/strong&gt;Good grounding in system design principles, with a growing ability to reason about scaling and reliability tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Collaborator: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and in a distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Agent Engineering Curiosity: &lt;/strong&gt;Genuine interest in LLM-powered features and agentic systems, and proactive in leveraging modern developer productivity tools, including GenAI assistants and coding agents, to accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of industry experience as a Software Engineer, with a track record of shipping production backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid backend proficiency in Python, with experience building and maintaining production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system design fundamentals and building reliable, scalable applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of relational databases and modern data storage technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to service-to-service communication (gRPC, Kafka) and caching (Redis) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS cloud services (S3, RDS) and deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes, Helm) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of service health, monitoring, and incident response practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing technical documentation and contributing to design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating LLM APIs (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic) into production applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to agent frameworks or patterns (e.g., LangChain, LangGraph, tool/function calling, ReAct-style agents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with prompt engineering, evaluation, and observability for AI-driven features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ML1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on AI in our process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Abnormal AI uses AI-assisted tools to help our recruiting team prepare for candidate interviews. These tools analyze resume content and role requirements to suggest interview questions and areas for the interviewer to explore.They do not make hiring decisions or screen candidates automatically. Every decision about a candidacy is made by a person. Further, if your application is successful and Abnormal AI makes a conditional offer of employment, we will carry out pre-employment checks which must be successfully completed to progress to a final offer. All processes and pre-employment checks are in line with prevailing legislation and Abnormal AI&#39;s policies relevant to our security and privacy standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abnormal AI is an equal opportunity employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law. For our EEO policy statement please &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt9cbda641db7c0045/6a1e3d3a66aea075cd33e462/AAP_and_EEO_Statement.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;click here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. If you would like more information on your EEO rights under the law, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt4eb3a265cc7b1ca9/6a1e3d3bfe33e73c16ff026b/EEOC_Know_Your_Rights_Oct_30_2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or Remote (UK) | 💰 £94,700 - £111,400 ➕ incentive awards tied to your performance | &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDAT6VxoqQM&quot;&gt;Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands-on, detail-oriented and proactive &lt;strong&gt;Operational Tax Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to support the Tax team at Monzo, and our wider Finance and Product teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be joining our Tax Team and will be leading on all taxes that touch our customers and their tax reporting, across the UK and Europe. You’ll report into our Tax Governance Lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role covers all taxes that relate to customer liabilities or customer tax reporting. These are a core part of product design: we make sure we comply with our own obligations, and we make it as easy as possible for customers to comply with theirs. As we launch new products and enter new markets, this is a key area of our tax strategy, and this role gives you the exciting opportunity to own it and work closely with diverse teams across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning operational tax:&lt;/strong&gt; Be Monzo’s subject matter expert on operational tax, advising the business and making sure we meet our obligations as we grow and enter new markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading compliance &amp;amp; controls: &lt;/strong&gt;Own our operational tax processes and controls across jurisdictions, including BBSI, ISA reporting, FATCA and CRS, Corporate Criminal Offence and CT61s, plus overseas equivalents. Build new processes and controls as our products and markets evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping new products:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and local market teams from the outset to embed tax into product design, build the right reporting and controls, and pressure-test edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staying ahead of change:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep on top of tax laws, regulations and case law across the UK and EU, translating changes into clear actions and helping Monzo prepare for new requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnering across Monzo: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with Product, Financial Crime, Engineering, Legal, EU Next Markets and Finance to solve problems and support business initiatives from an operational tax perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a qualified accountant and/or qualified tax advisor, or qualified by significant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant in-house experience working in Operational Tax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working relatively autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re energetic and are hands-on with your work, tackling whatever needs doing to make things happen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an eye for detail and enjoy working methodically through processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What we’re doing at Monzo excites you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £94,700 - £111,400 + incentive awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 We&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with the expectation of working from the London office on occasional basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
