&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ssential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in credit risk, credit analysis or portfolio management within a lending, private credit, or credit advisory environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial analysis and credit assessment skills, with the ability to review and challenge credit papers and identify key risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with portfolio monitoring or review processes, including identifying early signs of credit deterioration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable exercising judgement and holding delegated authority for credit decisions within defined parameters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to prepare clear reporting materials and provide credit recommendations to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educated to degree level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work autonomously, build effective relationships across teams, and constructively challenge origination and portfolio management colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
