&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c0fdb6d9afd1&quot;&gt;Build, lead, and grow a team of mostly senior software engineers, hiring well and helping senior and staff engineers grow their impact and careers&lt;/p&gt;
