&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1761&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7485705fd393&quot;&gt;Define release cadences and help customers adopt updates, managing breaking changes in SDKs that can&#39;t be rolled back once they&#39;re installed in customers&#39; apps&lt;/p&gt;
