&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ledgy, we’re on a mission to make Europe a powerhouse of entrepreneurship by building a modern, tech-driven equity management and financial reporting platform for private and public companies. In 2026, we aim to be the leading provider for European IPOs and reporting for share-based payments. We are a value-based company with a core focus on being humble, transparent, ambitious and impactful, all in order to delivery the best experience for our customers and end users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to partner with some of the world’s leading investors. New Enterprise Associates led our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2022/09/21/ledgy-a-carta-for-european-startups-to-manage-equity-and-cap-tables-raises-22m-from-nea-sequoia-and-more/&quot;&gt;$22m Series B&lt;/a&gt; round in 2022, with Philip Chopin joining Sequoia’s Luciana Lixandru on our board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in Switzerland in 2017 and today we operate globally from offices in Zurich and London. We encourage diversity and are an international team coming from 26 different countries and speaking 25 different languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about-the-role&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior DevOps Engineer at Ledgy, you&#39;ll build the infrastructure and tooling that help our engineers ship quickly and reliably. You&#39;ll join our Platform team, collaborating with engineers and InfoSec to improve CI/CD, observability, and cloud infrastructure for a product that helps companies manage equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our challenge is to make delivery faster, production easier to operate, and AI-assisted development safer - while keeping complexity and costs in check.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; We hire remotely across Spain, Germany, Poland, and Romania.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team you&#39;ll join:&lt;/strong&gt; Platform - Builds the infrastructure and tooling that help our engineers ship quickly and reliably, working with InfoSec to improve CI/CD, observability, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-work-on&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud infrastructure.&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our GCP and Kubernetes cloud architecture and setup with Terraform, improving reliability, simplicity, and cost visibility and enabling scaling to multiple availability regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and developer experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Speed up feedback loops, reduce flaky builds, and turn recurring support requests into self-service tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability.&lt;/strong&gt; Reduce alert noise, define meaningful SLOs, and make production issues easier to diagnose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and automation.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with InfoSec on secure delivery, access controls, and guardrails for AI-assisted workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also join our incident-response on-call rotation during working hours and help prevent recurring issues. As we expand our servicing of public companies and jurisdictions, this on-call might evolve to compensated 24h/7 hour rotation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;youll-thrive-in-this-role-if-you&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll Thrive in This Role If You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t tick every box. These are the things that would make you an especially good fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong DevOps / SRE background designing and operating cloud infrastructure and production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with Kubernetes and infrastructure as code, ideally GCP and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy building fast, reliable CI/CD pipelines and improving developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can diagnose issues across networking, infrastructure, and application code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write maintainable code and bring a practical approach to observability and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value collaboration, mentorship, and thoughtful trade-offs between reliability, complexity, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about supporting AI-assisted development safely - no AI specialism required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Node.js, MongoDB or Temporal is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;our-tech-stack&quot;&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work in TypeScript: React, Tailwind CSS, and tRPC on the front end, and tRPC, Node.js, MongoDB, and Temporal on the back end. Infrastructure runs on GCP, Terraform Cloud, Kubernetes, Docker, and GitHub Actions. For observability and incident response we use Grafana, Sentry, and PagerDuty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to know all of it. We don&#39;t expect proficiency in every part of this stack. Strong infrastructure fundamentals and the ability to learn matter more than knowing every tool already.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-your-journey-could-look-like&quot;&gt;What Your Journey Could Look Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 30 days:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to know Ledgy, the Platform team, and our internal users with an onboarding buddy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore our infrastructure and delivery workflows, and ship your first improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current state of our cloud infrastructure and propose meaningful enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 3 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently deliver improvements to CI/CD, observability, or infrastructure design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share operational ownership and help reduce recurring friction for engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architecture discussions and document what others need to operate our systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6-12 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own DevOps and SRE function and DevOps initiatives from problem definition through rollout and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable improvements to developer experience, reliability, or cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape our platform&#39;s direction and mentor other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-interview-process&quot;&gt;The interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting to know you (45 min):&lt;/strong&gt; Meet with someone from our people team to talk about your experience and to ask questions about the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live Coding (60 min):&lt;/strong&gt; An equity domain problem to solve collaboratively using your preferred language and IDE. We want to see how you think, so this step does not allow AI. But you can freely look up syntax questions if you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Design (60 min):&lt;/strong&gt; A system design session where you will design an architecture for a problem from the Ledgy domain using a visual tool of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DDSA (45 min):&lt;/strong&gt; A Deep Dive into real System Architecture that you have built, owned and monitored.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A chance to meet one of our founders and your hiring manager for a 30-minute chat about Ledgy&#39;s mission and values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer&lt;/strong&gt; 🎉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;being-part-of-ledgy-means&quot;&gt;Being part of Ledgy means&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge and re-energize with flexible working hours, 25 days of vacation, and up to 40 days of remote work from outside your home country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make space for your own professional development, with a generous yearly learning &amp;amp; development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will receive a competitive salary + benefits + equity. All salaries are aligned with competitively benchmarked ranges based on work location and levelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute Verifone’s marketing strategy in France and play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth in one of Europe’s most dynamic payments markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Marketing Manager, you’ll be the engine behind France’s marketing performance: building the systems, dashboards, and processes that power smarter decisions, stronger campaigns, and measurable commercial impact. You’ll lead both day‑to‑day execution and long‑term strategy, ensuring our brand, messaging, and demand generation efforts land with precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full marketing funnel - from awareness and acquisition to retention and installed‑base growth and you’ll bring hands‑on expertise in marketing automation, lead nurturing, and multi‑channel campaign orchestration. Email, digital, content, events… you know how to blend them into high‑performing programs that generate qualified leads and fuel sales momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries clear accountability: hitting France’s lead targets, elevating lead quality and conversion, enriching data, automating processes, and delivering sharp reporting across programs and channels. Your work will directly influence pipeline, performance, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, manage and implement marketing programs and strategies for Verifone France and Paybox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and update the Verifone Regional websites (Including Paybox): website maintenance, supervising the creation and development of websites, including creating specification documents to improve the website and other online projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the advertising campaigns and the relationship with the agency, including creating lists of keywords that define campaigns, creating and testing ads/banners specific for targeted verticals, set-up and monitor end to end lead tracking (sources/channels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess about results: analyze site traffic and website flows, conversion optimization campaign results, analyze and report program performance; report metrics appropriately and flag issues for internal stakeholders, provide recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose new marketing strategies and implement new ideas that can improve overall funnel performance, from brand awareness to client retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage email nurture flows and/or drip programs for both prospects and existing customers to support sales growth and retention, and implement the tracking of these flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple teams for developing an effective strategy and new programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French speaker with advanced English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, or a related field, with strong foundations in modern digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading integrated, multi‑channel marketing campaigns across digital, content, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on mastery of key platforms, including &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=Explain_marketing_automation_tools&quot;&gt;marketing automation tools&lt;/span&gt; (Pardot, Marketo, etc.), &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=What_is_a_CRM_and_how_is_it_used&quot;&gt;CRMs&lt;/span&gt; such as Salesforce or Pipedrive, Google Analytics, social platforms (Facebook, Instagram), and email marketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical capability to manage complex lead lifecycles, optimize funnel performance, and extract insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills to coordinate cross‑functional initiatives and deliver high‑impact marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up‑to‑date knowledge of industry trends, emerging technologies, and modern marketing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEM‑focused copywriting skills to craft compelling, conversion‑driven search content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML for landing page and email optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert‑level Excel skills, including large dataset handling and macro‑based automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in suggesting new concepts/ideas, self-motivated, fast learner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented and problem-solving attitude (use analytical and creative thinking to find solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, great attention to detail, openness to testing and analyzing large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: ability to cooperate and work fairly with others, at all levels, within and outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work under tight deadlines when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Delivery Transformation Principal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to drive the successful execution and delivery of complex transformation projects and key work-streams. The ideal candidate is a hands-on practitioner and subject matter expert with a proven track record of delivering challenging, high-impact projects at top-tier consulting or digital engineering firms. This is a unique opportunity to lead the end-to-end delivery of critical client workstreams whilst actively shaping our modern agile practices and mentoring high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the planning, execution, and delivery of complex, high-risk transformation projects and core workstreams. Solve ambiguous delivery challenges, unblock technical and operational dependencies, and champion agile ways of working to ensure initiatives are delivered on time, within budget, and to the highest quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain strong, trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders and department leads. Act as a trusted delivery advisor, guide stakeholders through technical and delivery trade-offs, and navigate difficult or sensitive conversations with diplomacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership and Program Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide hands-on mentorship and constructive feedback to cross-functional project teams, fostering a culture of continuous learning and accountability. Oversee day-to-day workstream execution, sprint planning, and team operational health, while supporting internal capability building and interviewing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and pursue opportunities for project extension and process improvements within existing accounts. Partner with client leads and solution teams by evaluating statements of work, scoping delivery efforts, and contributing technical delivery insights to proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of total professional experience, including 4+ years leading complex project delivery or agile workstreams within a management consultancy, technology consulting firm, or digital engineering services company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in leading and delivering complex, multi-disciplinary software or digital transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in &lt;strong&gt;managing fixed price and outcome based deliveries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, facilitation, and influencing skills with the ability to articulate complex concepts and handle objections across senior stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German (minimum C1 fluency) required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;Work Modality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid (with up to 40% client-site travel)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
